  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, the heartless can unleash the power contained within their heart core in a sudden burst of energy. As a standard action that lowers their stress by 1, the heartless can deal 1d6 damage to all creatures, except themselves, within a 30 foot cone. A Reflex save (DC 10 + 1/2 heartless level + Constitution modifier) halves the damage. The exact nature of the damage is determined by the heartless’s heart core. The heartless must have at least 1 stress to use this ability.</p>\n<p>At 3rd level, and every odd level after that, the damage dealt by core rupture increases by 1d6, to a maximum of 10d6 at 19th level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/heartless#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
